hermes-plugin-e2b
=================

This plugin adds an `e2b` terminal backend to Hermes Agent
(https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent) through the public
terminal-environment provider plugin API. It ships as a standalone repository
and makes no changes to Hermes core.


Prior art and attribution
-------------------------

The E2B terminal backend for Hermes was first proposed and implemented as an
in-tree backend by **Berkant Ay** (<berkantay.5@gmail.com>, GitHub: berkantay)
in NousResearch/hermes-agent pull request #18348:

    https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/pull/18348

That work is the origin of this plugin. Hermes policy does not accept
third-party product integrations into the core tree (CONTRIBUTING.md,
"Third-Party Product Integrations: Ship as a Standalone Plugin"), and a Hermes
maintainer invited a plugin-repo version of that pull request while leaving the
pull request itself open for its author to decide:

    https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/pull/18348#issuecomment-5404654390

This repository is that plugin-repo version. It is a re-architecture rather
than a port: the lifecycle, identity, and state models were redesigned against
the public plugin contract introduced in PR #94400. Several E2B-specific
insights are carried over from #18348 and are credited inline in the source
where they apply.


